{#- The photo placeholder: the event's logo, centred in a photo's frame under the photo
   (programs.twig's gallery), so a photo that is still loading, or failed, leaves the
   event's mark on `tonal` rather than an empty box. Domů's `mainLogo`, with its dark twin
   when the event has one, else the tab bar's `menuLogo`, else nothing: the frame alone.
   Decorative, so alt is empty; lazy like the photo over it. No whitespace around it: the
   frame's markup is asserted as one string. -#}
{%- if event.assets.mainLogo and event.assets.mainLogoDark -%}
	<img class="photo-mark mode-light-only" src="{{ event.assets.mainLogo }}" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><img class="photo-mark mode-dark-only" src="{{ event.assets.mainLogoDark }}" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
{%- elseif event.assets.mainLogo -%}
	<img class="photo-mark" src="{{ event.assets.mainLogo }}" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
{%- elseif event.assets.menuLogo -%}
	<img class="photo-mark" src="{{ event.assets.menuLogo }}" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
{%- endif -%}
